  32:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           Reference Manual.
  33:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  34:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The COMP output is available using HAL_COMP_GetOutputLevel()
  35:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           and can be set on GPIO pins.
  36:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           For STM32F3xx devices please refer to the COMP peripheral section in corresponding
  37:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           Reference Manual.
  38:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  39:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The COMP output can be redirected to embedded timers (TIM1, TIM2, TIM3...).
  40:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           For STM32F3xx devices please refer to the COMP peripheral section in corresponding
  41:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           Reference Manual.
  42:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  43:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Each couple of comparators COMP1 and COMP2, COMP3 and COMP4, COMP5 and COMP6 can be combi
  44:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           mode and respectively COMP1, COMP3 and COMP5 non inverting input is used as common non-in
  45:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  46:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The seven comparators have interrupt capability with wake-up
  47:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           from Sleep and Stop modes (through the EXTI controller):
  48:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP1 is internally connected to EXTI Line 21
  49:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP2 is internally connected to EXTI Line 22
  50:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP3 is internally connected to EXTI Line 29
  51:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP4 is internally connected to EXTI Line 30
  52:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP5 is internally connected to EXTI Line 31
  53:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP6 is internally connected to EXTI Line 32
  54:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP7 is internally connected to EXTI Line 33.
  55:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  56:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           From the corresponding IRQ handler, the right interrupt source can be retrieved with the
  57:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           adequate macro __HAL_COMP_COMPx_EXTI_GET_FLAG().
