  61:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** ================================================================================
  62:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   [..]
  63:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       This driver provides functions to configure and program the Comparators of all STM32F3xx devi
  64:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  65:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       To use the comparator, perform the following steps:
  66:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  67:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Fill in the HAL_COMP_MspInit() to
  68:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Configure the comparator input in analog mode using HAL_GPIO_Init()
  69:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Configure the comparator output in alternate function mode using HAL_GPIO_Init() to map 
  70:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****            output to the GPIO pin
  71:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) If required enable the COMP interrupt (EXTI line Interrupt): by configuring and enabling
  72:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****            selecting the desired sensitivity level using HAL_GPIO_Init() function. After that enabl
  73:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****            interrupt vector using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() and HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ() functions.
  74:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  75:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Configure the comparator using HAL_COMP_Init() function:
  76:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the inverting input (input minus)
  77:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the non-inverting input (input plus)
  78:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the output polarity
  79:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the output redirection
  80:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the hysteresis level
  81:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the power mode
  82:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the event/interrupt mode
  83:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  84:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       -@@- HAL_COMP_Init() calls internally __HAL_RCC_SYSCFG_CLK_ENABLE() in order
  85:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           to enable the comparator(s).
  86:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
