  87:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) On-the-fly reconfiguration of comparator(s) may be done by calling again HAL_COMP_Init(
  88:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           function with new input parameter values; HAL_COMP_MspInit() function shall be adapted
