  94:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           to manage comparator outputs (events and output level).
  95:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  96:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Disable the comparator using HAL_COMP_Stop() or HAL_COMP_Stop_IT()
  97:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           function.
  98:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  99:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) De-initialize the comparator using HAL_COMP_DeInit() function.
 100:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
