 104:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 105:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     =============================================
 106:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 107:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 108:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      The compilation flag USE_HAL_COMP_REGISTER_CALLBACKS, when set to 1,
 109:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 110:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Use Functions HAL_COMP_RegisterCallback()
 111:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      to register an interrupt callback.
 112:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 113:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 114:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Function HAL_COMP_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 115:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) OperationCpltCallback : callback for End of operation.
 116:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback         : callback for error detection.
 117:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback       : callback for Msp Init.
 118:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback     : callback for Msp DeInit.
 119:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 120:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      and a pointer to the user callback function.
 121:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 122:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 123:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Use function HAL_COMP_UnRegisterCallback to reset a callback to the default
 124:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      weak function.
 125:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 126:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 127:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      HAL_COMP_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 128:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      and the Callback ID.
 129:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 130:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) OperationCpltCallback : callback for End of operation.
 131:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback         : callback for error detection.
 132:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback       : callback for Msp Init.
 133:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback     : callback for Msp DeInit.
 134:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      [..]
 135:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 136:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      By default, after the HAL_COMP_Init() and when the state is HAL_COMP_STATE_RESET
 137:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 138:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      examples HAL_COMP_OperationCpltCallback(), HAL_COMP_ErrorCallback().
 139:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 140:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_COMP_Init()/ HAL_COMP_DeInit() only when
 141:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 142:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 143:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\nakas\AppData\Local\Temp\ccgKc1U5.s 			page 4


 144:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_COMP_Init()/ HAL_COMP_DeInit()
 145:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
 146:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      [..]
 147:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 148:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_COMP_STATE_READY state only.
 149:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit functions that can be registered/unregistered
 150:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      in HAL_COMP_STATE_READY or HAL_COMP_STATE_RESET state,
 151:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 152:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 153:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 154:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Then, the user first registers the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 155:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      using HAL_COMP_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_COMP_DeInit()
 156:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      or HAL_COMP_Init() function.
 157:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      [..]
 158:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 159:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      When the compilation flag USE_HAL_COMP_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 160:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 161:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      are set to the corresponding weak functions.
 162:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 163:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   ******************************************************************************
 164:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   */
