1028:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the inverting input
1029:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is low when the non-inverting input is at a higher
